Package: tsclient
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rdesktop (>= 1.9.0)
Description: GTK4 frontend for remote desktop clients
 Terminal Server Client (tsclient) configures rdesktop, FreeRDP, VNC viewers,
 and other remote desktop tools. It reads Windows RDP files and saves JSON
 profiles, with optional password storage in the desktop keyring.
 Additional backends are optional and must be installed separately.
